hat_message_metadata_passthrough\":{\"turn_id\":\"01a0eed1-41be-7b50-84cf-6cac8e5de61c\"}}}\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/cases/case09-baseline/tools/materialize-seed.py:2:r=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[1]; o=r/'scratch/unused-seed.dat'; o.parent.mkdir(exist_ok=True); o.write_text((r/'inputs/seed.txt').read_text())\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/cases/case09-baseline/README.md:1:Materialize a scratch seed with `python3 tools/materialize-seed.py`.\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:8780:            \"description\": \"Use when the user wants verbatim customer or prospect quotes, voice-of-customer evidence, theme validation, objection evidence, product-friction examples, or support for a product area, use case, or sales narrative. Retrieve from transcripts, call notes, supplied transcript-like recordings or exports, and other grounded call material using explicit speaker-confidence and provenance rules. Read the Sales index and this focused workflow even when the user already supplied every transcript excerpt.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:78956:        \"description\": \"Sugra API is intelligence infrastructure for AI agents and decision platforms: one key and one normalized format for cross-domain primary-source data, surfaced to agents through the Model Context Protocol. The connector exposes a small, stable tool surface over the full Sugra catalog of more than 1,300 endpoints aggregating 130+ primary sources across data domains including markets, macroeconomics and central banks, corporate filings, public finance, trade flows, agriculture, climate and natural events, maritime activity, prediction markets, global news, network intelligence, and entity screening. Main workflows: discover endpoints by natural-language search and inspect their schemas, run a one-step find-and-call to retrieve data, pull macroeconomic series and central-bank rates, fetch market prices, history and fundamentals through Sugra Finance, screen a person or organization name against sanctions corpora, resolve free text to a canonical entity, and compose a normalized current view or bounded timeseries for an entity with freshness and provenance. Works with Anthropic, OpenAI, Google, and xAI model families and any MCP-enabled client. A free Sugra account is the only connection requirement; the read-only surface never writes, deletes, sends, or publishes.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:78973:          \"long_description\": \"Sugra API is intelligence infrastructure for AI agents and decision platforms: one key and one normalized format for cross-domain primary-source data, surfaced to agents through the Model Context Protocol. The connector exposes a small, stable tool surface over the full Sugra catalog of more than 1,300 endpoints aggregating 130+ primary sources across data domains including markets, macroeconomics and central banks, corporate filings, public finance, trade flows, agriculture, climate and natural events, maritime activity, prediction markets, global news, network intelligence, and entity screening. Main workflows: discover endpoints by natural-language search and inspect their schemas, run a one-step find-and-call to retrieve data, pull macroeconomic series and central-bank rates, fetch market prices, history and fundamentals through Sugra Finance, screen a person or organization name against sanctions corpora, resolve free text to a canonical entity, and compose a normalized current view or bounded timeseries for an entity with freshness and provenance. Works with Anthropic, OpenAI, Google, and xAI model families and any MCP-enabled client. A free Sugra account is the only connection requirement; the read-only surface never writes, deletes, sends, or publishes.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:107083:        \"description\": \"Scan public websites for fast preliminary cookie/tracker evidence, then continue to persisted privacy findings, typed GPC response comparisons, bounded Accept and Reject observations, policy signals, and HTTPS/TLS. Results preserve provenance and explicit coverage limitations for human review; they are not legal advice, certification, or a compliance determination.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:107100:          \"long_description\": \"Scan public websites for fast preliminary cookie/tracker evidence, then continue to persisted privacy findings, typed GPC response comparisons, bounded Accept and Reject observations, policy signals, and HTTPS/TLS. Results preserve provenance and explicit coverage limitations for human review; they are not legal advice, certification, or a compliance determination.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:141420:            \"description\": \"Audit an EduInsights answer, comparison, SQL result, or research method for source provenance, release and period alignment, entity resolution, level of detail, coverage, applicability, additive measures, and unsupported causal claims. Use when the person asks to verify, review, reproduce, challenge, or quality-check education or workforce evidence.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:146288:        \"description\": \"Stele gives AI agents a shared, persistent knowledge graph and task system for projects. It helps users recall decisions and lessons, inspect provenance, capture durable knowledge, coordinate claimed work, and preserve context across ChatGPT, Codex, Claude, Cursor, and other MCP-compatible agents.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:146305:          \"long_description\": \"Stele gives AI agents a shared, persistent knowledge graph and task system for projects. It helps users recall decisions and lessons, inspect provenance, capture durable knowledge, coordinate claimed work, and preserve context across ChatGPT, Codex, Claude, Cursor, and other MCP-compatible agents.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:146327:            \"description\": \"Use Stele as durable, shared project memory and work tracking. Apply this skill when the user wants to recall project context, trace decisions and provenance, save knowledge, inspect or coordinate tasks, organize a roadmap, or leave a handoff for another agent or teammate.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:146330:              \"short_description\": \"Use Stele as durable, shared project memory and work tracking. Apply this skill when the user wants to recall project context, trace decisions and provenance, save knowledge, inspect or coordinate tasks, organize a roadmap, or leave a handoff for another agent or teammate.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:156863:        \"description\": \"IAJUS helps research Brazilian case law, qualified precedents, and legislation. Its 28 MCP tools search the IAJUS legal corpus and, when needed, read official public sources. Results include provenance and official links when available. The app does not search people by private identifiers and cannot file, sign, or modify court records.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:156880:          \"long_description\": \"IAJUS helps research Brazilian case law, qualified precedents, and legislation. Its 28 MCP tools search the IAJUS legal corpus and, when needed, read official public sources. Results include provenance and official links when available. The app does not search people by private identifiers and cannot file, sign, or modify court records.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:158549:            \"description\": \"Validate or read a SINGLE U.S. statutory or regulatory citation the user names — confirm it resolves to real, in-force law and return the official text with a clickable provenance link. This is the free OpenRegs capability: one named citation in, verified text out. The trigger is a specific citation in hand: use this skill, in preference to the research assistant, whenever the user names one to check or read (e.g. \\\"is Tex. Lab. Code § 411.103 real?\\\", \\\"is 29 U.S.C. § 201 still good law?\\\", \\\"pull Cal. Lab. Code § 512\\\"). It does NOT search by topic, compare jurisdictions, or do open research — when the user names no specific citation and needs law found, compared, or explored, that is the research assistant's job, and this skill points there.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:158552:              \"short_description\": \"Validate or read a SINGLE U.S. statutory or regulatory citation the user names — confirm it resolves to real, in-force law and return the official text with a clickable provenance link. This is the free OpenRegs capability: one named citation in, verified text out. The trigger is a specific citation in hand: use this skill, in preference to the research assistant, whenever the user names one to check or read (e.g. \\\"is Tex. Lab. Code § 411.103 real?\\\", \\\"is 29 U.S.C. § 201 still good law?\\\", \\\"pull Cal. Lab. Code § 512\\\"). It does NOT search by topic, compare jurisdictions, or do open research — when the user names no specific citation and needs law found, compared, or explored, that is the research assistant's job, and this skill points there.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:159241:            \"Retrieve a healthcare-professional warning from an official medicine label and show the passage with full provenance.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:160974:            \"description\": \"Investigate whether one specific npm package is trustworthy — maintainer/ownership takeover signals, publish-provenance mismatches, and risky install scripts. Use when the user asks if a single named package is safe, compromised, hijacked, suspicious, or \\\"can I trust this\\\" — not for auditing a full package.json/lockfile (see dependency-audit) and not for a plain factual question like \\\"what does X do.\\\"\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:160977:              \"short_description\": \"Investigate whether one specific npm package is trustworthy — maintainer/ownership takeover signals, publish-provenance mismatches, and risky install scripts. Use when the user asks if a single named package is safe, compromised, hijacked, suspicious, or \\\"can I trust this\\\" — not for auditing a full package.json/lockfile (see dependency-audit) and not for a plain factual question like \\\"what does X do.\\\"\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:164555:        \"description\": \"Mondoir.art is a platform for discovering, collecting, and understanding contemporary art. It connects collectors, galleries, and artists through a structured ecosystem that combines traditional art practices with AI-assisted insights and modern documentation tools.\\n\\nThrough the Mondoir.art app, users can explore curated artworks, learn about artists and collections, and access contextual information about artworks, valuation, provenance, and editions. The platform is designed to make the art world easier to navigate by organizing information that is often fragmented across galleries, marketplaces, and social platforms.\\n\\nCollectors can use the app to research artworks, track editions, and explore how contemporary art is presented and documented. Artists and galleries can present their work in a structured environment that supports discovery and documentation.\\n\\nBy integrating with ChatGPT, the Mondoir.art app allows users to ask questions about artists, artworks, exhibitions, and collecting — turning complex art information into clear and accessible conversations.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:164572:          \"long_description\": \"Mondoir.art is a platform for discovering, collecting, and understanding contemporary art. It connects collectors, galleries, and artists through a structured ecosystem that combines traditional art practices with AI-assisted insights and modern documentation tools.\\n\\nThrough the Mondoir.art app, users can explore curated artworks, learn about artists and collections, and access contextual information about artworks, valuation, provenance, and editions. The platform is designed to make the art world easier to navigate by organizing information that is often fragmented across galleries, marketplaces, and social platforms.\\n\\nCollectors can use the app to research artworks, track editions, and explore how contemporary art is presented and documented. Artists and galleries can present their work in a structured environment that supports discovery and documentation.\\n\\nBy integrating with ChatGPT, the Mondoir.art app allows users to ask questions about artists, artworks, exhibitions, and collecting — turning complex art information into clear and accessible conversations.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:188950:        \"description\": \"DigiTrust Evidence Assistant is a read-only public demo for security and procurement review. It lists and summarizes synthetic evidence packets, generates customer-safe assurance summaries, compares readiness, and produces deterministic v2 reviews with claim-to-evidence links, verification, provenance, findings, limitations, and external-use eligibility. All data is synthetic; the app cannot approve or authorize external use, modify records, notify third parties, process payments, or access paid customer workspaces.https://www.digitranshq.com/contact\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:188967:          \"long_description\": \"DigiTrust Evidence Assistant is a read-only public demo for security and procurement review. It lists and summarizes synthetic evidence packets, generates customer-safe assurance summaries, compares readiness, and produces deterministic v2 reviews with claim-to-evidence links, verification, provenance, findings, limitations, and external-use eligibility. All data is synthetic; the app cannot approve or authorize external use, modify records, notify third parties, process payments, or access paid customer workspaces.https://www.digitranshq.com/contact\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:188975:          \"default_prompt\": \"Review the Vendor Review packet: show claim links, verification, provenance, findings, limitations, and external-use status.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:188977:            \"Review the Vendor Review packet: show claim links, verification, provenance, findings, limitations, and external-use status.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:191838:          \"long_description\": \"Molecular Structure Viewer provides a compact Select, Analyze, Compare, Related data, Style, Animate, and Export workbench over Mol*. Use one revisioned atom-level query and scene contract across the UI and Codex to measure geometry, browse source-relative molecular companions, inspect contacts and density, compare aligned structures, style independent layers, play trajectories, restore named scenes and durable digest-bound projects, export provenance-rich results, and render publication images or editable presentation movies.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:196748:        \"description\": \"Connect ChatGPT and Codex to evidence from files you select and index in Axiomyx Personal. Search your evidence, retrieve relevant passages, and check their source provenance. Access is read-only: this plugin does not modify your source files or run commands. Axiomyx Personal must be installed, running, online, and connected. You approve the connection in the desktop app. Your index remains on your computer; requested evidence is transmitted through an authenticated relay to the AI service you connect.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:196765:          \"long_description\": \"Connect ChatGPT and Codex to evidence from files you select and index in Axiomyx Personal. Search your evidence, retrieve relevant passages, and check their source provenance. Access is read-only: this plugin does not modify your source files or run commands. Axiomyx Personal must be installed, running, online, and connected. You approve the connection in the desktop app. Your index remains on your computer; requested evidence is transmitted through an authenticated relay to the AI service you connect.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:196777:            \"Check the provenance of the Axiomyx evidence used in your last answer.\"\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:200422:        \"description\": \"Aviation reference tools for analysts, researchers and product teams. Resolve airports, airlines, aircraft types, registrations and flight identifiers with confidence, historical validity and source provenance. Inspect airport network integration, operator and ownership facts, engagement exceptions, connectivity and passenger-size bands. Explore a catalogue of aviation AI use cases, their data requirements, message lineage and an EASA framework screen. Reference and research data only: not live operational, flight-status, booking or safety-control information. Users can also submit product feedback for human review.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:200439:          \"long_description\": \"Aviation reference tools for analysts, researchers and product teams. Resolve airports, airlines, aircraft types, registrations and flight identifiers with confidence, historical validity and source provenance. Inspect airport network integration, operator and ownership facts, engagement exceptions, connectivity and passenger-size bands. Explore a catalogue of aviation AI use cases, their data requirements, message lineage and an EASA framework screen. Reference and research data only: not live operational, flight-status, booking or safety-control information. Users can also submit product feedback for human review.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:202792:          \"default_prompt\": \"Fetch ENA DRR037765 first 500 reads to active workspace; open and report live length range, GC, Q30, and subset provenance\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:202794:            \"Fetch ENA DRR037765 first 500 reads to active workspace; open and report live length range, GC, Q30, and subset provenance\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:218720:            \"description\": \"Take a responsive musical turn in the active VeyrPiano composition while preserving the musician's material, provenance, and authoritative revision. Use when a VeyrPiano session is active and the user says “your go,” “your turn,” “continue,” “add something,” asks for a musical response or variation, or otherwise hands creative agency to the assistant.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:218732:            \"description\": \"Help a musician operate the connected VeyrPiano instrument with concise, capability-accurate guidance. Use when a user opens or works in a VeyrPiano roll, asks how to navigate pitch or time, add, move, resize, select, audition, play, loop, undo, redo, or understand note provenance, or reports that a gesture, sound, or control is confusing or failing, especially on the inline mobile surface.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:218735:              \"short_description\": \"Help a musician operate the connected VeyrPiano instrument with concise, capability-accurate guidance. Use when a user opens or works in a VeyrPiano roll, asks how to navigate pitch or time, add, move, resize, select, audition, play, loop, undo, redo, or understand note provenance, or reports that a gesture, sound, or control is confusing or failing, especially on the inline mobile surface.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:226337:            \"description\": \"Inspect Adaptyv Bio experiments, lifecycle status, updates, sequences, quotes, invoices, and results without changing them. Use for monitoring, progress summaries, returned assay data, provenance, or read-only account questions.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:242111:        \"description\": \"Neurnav helps you manage long-form documents—like research notes and reports—with Git-style workflows inside ChatGPT. Open a report, see exactly which branch and revision you’re working on, and collaborate with clear diffs, staged edits, and review-ready integration requests. Every change can carry provenance metadata (AI suggestion vs. human approval) so you can publish and share with confidence. You can share a public link to the latest snapshot—all without losing traceability or context.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:242127:          \"short_description\": \"Write document with provenance\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:242128:          \"long_description\": \"Neurnav helps you manage long-form documents—like research notes and reports—with Git-style workflows inside ChatGPT. Open a report, see exactly which branch and revision you’re working on, and collaborate with clear diffs, staged edits, and review-ready integration requests. Every change can carry provenance metadata (AI suggestion vs. human approval) so you can publish and share with confidence. You can share a public link to the latest snapshot—all without losing traceability or context.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:262775:        \"description\": \"Bring PlateLens—an AI-powered calorie and nutrition tracker—into ChatGPT. Ask about the data you already log: review calories, macros, micronutrients, and ingredients; understand your estimated calorie deficit or surplus against your plan; summarize hydration and activity; follow weight changes against your goals; and review recorded glucose readings with their measurement times and provenance when you grant the separate glucose permission. The integration is read-only and cannot create, edit, or delete PlateLens data. Results reflect estimates and synced observations in your account, not diagnoses, treatment advice, or medication recommendations.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:262792:          \"long_description\": \"Bring PlateLens—an AI-powered calorie and nutrition tracker—into ChatGPT. Ask about the data you already log: review calories, macros, micronutrients, and ingredients; understand your estimated calorie deficit or surplus against your plan; summarize hydration and activity; follow weight changes against your goals; and review recorded glucose readings with their measurement times and provenance when you grant the separate glucose permission. The integration is read-only and cannot create, edit, or delete PlateLens data. Results reflect estimates and synced observations in your account, not diagnoses, treatment advice, or medication recommendations.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:263619:            \"description\": \"Use Astrofaith to resolve locations, calculate authoritative Swiss Ephemeris charts, find planet-in-natal-house transit periods, and securely manage the connected member's saved birth profiles. Includes exact MCP payloads, provenance, settings, output selection, and environment data-boundary guidance.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:263622:              \"short_description\": \"Use Astrofaith to resolve locations, calculate authoritative Swiss Ephemeris charts, find planet-in-natal-house transit periods, and securely manage the connected member's saved birth profiles. Includes exact MCP payloads, provenance, settings, output selection, and environment data-boundary guidance.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:276243:        \"description\": \"Testfolio connects an eligible Testfolio account to portfolio research in ChatGPT. Backtest and compare portfolios, analyze assets, optimize allocations, evaluate tactical strategies and signals, and study retirement withdrawals, Monte Carlo scenarios, leveraged ETFs, factors, and principal components. Results explain the effective data period, assumptions, ticker provenance, key metrics, and compact summaries of large datasets. Analysis calls record account usage and may consume analysis credits. Users can explicitly create a public configuration link after a successful supported analysis. Testfolio supports historical, simulated, and hypothetical research; it does not execute trades or move money. Access requires Testfolio Max or a separate MCP grant, with tools subject to the connected account's limits.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:276260:          \"long_description\": \"Testfolio connects an eligible Testfolio account to portfolio research in ChatGPT. Backtest and compare portfolios, analyze assets, optimize allocations, evaluate tactical strategies and signals, and study retirement withdrawals, Monte Carlo scenarios, leveraged ETFs, factors, and principal components. Results explain the effective data period, assumptions, ticker provenance, key metrics, and compact summaries of large datasets. Analysis calls record account usage and may consume analysis credits. Users can explicitly create a public configuration link after a successful supported analysis. Testfolio supports historical, simulated, and hypothetical research; it does not execute trades or move money. Access requires Testfolio Max or a separate MCP grant, with tools subject to the connected account's limits.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:280724:            \"description\": \"Trace BD deals (licensing, M&A, R&D collaborations, joint ventures) for a company, asset, indication, or deal type, and return structured deal-level evidence with provenance. Use for transaction questions, for example 'who has licensed X', 'what deals have been done in obesity'.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:280844:            \"description\": \"Return the round-by-round financing record (amounts, dates, investors, provenance) for a named company, or filtered by indication, mechanism, target, or investor. Use when someone wants the actual rounds, for example 'list the funding rounds for X', 'who invested in their Series B'. Use funding-landscape when they want a market-level capital picture rather than a round list.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:294263:        \"description\": \"Lexiara helps users search EU and UK legislation, retrieve provision-level text with source provenance, trace amendments and transposition links, compare authentic-language terms, and check corpus coverage and freshness in ChatGPT.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:294280:          \"long_description\": \"Lexiara helps users search EU and UK legislation, retrieve provision-level text with source provenance, trace amendments and transposition links, compare authentic-language terms, and check corpus coverage and freshness in ChatGPT.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:297178:        \"description\": \"Wolfire Workspace helps authorized game developers inspect their games, dated store checks, saved build provenance and release reports. Ask what needs attention and follow evidence back to the dashboard. Prepare public listing observations for review; saving requires confirmation in the dashboard. Requires an invited workspace account. This plugin does not run builds, download artifacts or publish releases.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:297195:          \"long_description\": \"Wolfire Workspace helps authorized game developers inspect their games, dated store checks, saved build provenance and release reports. Ask what needs attention and follow evidence back to the dashboard. Prepare public listing observations for review; saving requires confirmation in the dashboard. Requires an invited workspace account. This plugin does not run builds, download artifacts or publish releases.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:297451:        \"description\": \"Perlucem helps community bank executives understand their institution's performance in plain language. It provides bank-scoped access to regulatory-filing data, quarterly metric trends, peer comparisons, five-pillar TBPI scores, grounded analytical explanations, report content, data provenance, and secure data uploads. TBPI covers Revenue, Cost & Efficiency, Risk, Capital, and Operations on a 1–5 scale, with results grounded in deterministic analysis of FFIEC Call Report and UBPR data. Access requires a Perlucem account and is restricted to institutions assigned to the authenticated user.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:297468:          \"long_description\": \"Perlucem helps community bank executives understand their institution's performance in plain language. It provides bank-scoped access to regulatory-filing data, quarterly metric trends, peer comparisons, five-pillar TBPI scores, grounded analytical explanations, report content, data provenance, and secure data uploads. TBPI covers Revenue, Cost & Efficiency, Risk, Capital, and Operations on a 1–5 scale, with results grounded in deterministic analysis of FFIEC Call Report and UBPR data. Access requires a Perlucem account and is restricted to institutions assigned to the authenticated user.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:302852:            \"description\": \"Use when Clara must validate a completed advisory memo, report, analysis, presentation, or other supported professional document against advisory_contract.json and available evidence. Review contract fit, support, calculations and provenance, reasoning, contradictions, recommendation fit, judgement boundaries, correction needs, uncertainty, and delivery readiness without turning the workflow into legal, tax, compliance, or jurisdictional research.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:304969:        \"description\": \"Consent-aware, local-first project memory with cited retrieval and provenance.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:304978:          \"provenance\"\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:304982:          \"long_description\": \"Use Talamus through a consent-aware CLI workflow to search and recall local project notes, inspect provenance, history, graph links, and brain health. The plugin installs no package, MCP server, hook, or capture process.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:305006:            \"description\": \"Use Talamus as durable, local-first memory for a local agent project. Use when retrieving cited project decisions, inspecting provenance or note history, diagnosing a Talamus brain, exploring graph relationships, previewing repository ingestion, or reviewing pending memory changes without applying them.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:305333:          \"provenance\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:307556:          \"long_description\": \"Eighteen measured Agent Skills for the full GeoAI lifecycle, with explicit safeguards for CRS, spatial leakage, uncertainty, provenance, and silent geospatial failure modes.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:308305:          \"provenance\"\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:311007:          \"provenance\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:311037:            \"description\": \"Review, explain, verify, or compare evidence-backed engineering decisions with Proofline. Use for ADRs, exact source citations, provenance review, stale-decision checks, Decision Evidence Packages, review receipts, and signed attestations.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:316512:            \"description\": \"Review digital evidence for provenance, integrity, acquisition quality, authenticity, metadata, timeline, attribution, and admissibility gaps. Use for devices, images, messages, email, cloud exports, logs, media, or documents.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:316517:              \"default_prompt\": \"Use $digital-evidence-reviewer to assess this digital evidence for provenance, integrity, acquisition, metadata, timeline, attribution, and admissibility gaps.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:316548:            \"description\": \"Plan and document lawful, ethical, reproducible open-source intelligence collection. Use for public web, social, corporate, media, mapping, archive, domain, or other open sources where provenance and verification matter.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:326219:          \"long_description\": \"Think wider. Frame better. Build what matters. MightShape preserves the momentum of a promising idea while testing whether it solves the right human problem. It combines an adaptive human-centered design practice, ten persistent fictional collaborators with complete lives and bounded expertise, sealed independent divergence, strict evidence provenance, research-grounded synthetic inquiry, real-human interview workflows, visual affinity and process maps, rapid prototypes, and an advisory Build Gate. Optional separately deployed adapters bring facilitated team exercises to Slack, Discord, and Microsoft Teams.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:326246:            \"description\": \"Facilitate human-centered product, service, AI, workflow, policy, and systems design through iterative design thinking, a persistent ten-person fictional Council, sealed divergence, evidence provenance, Inquiry Lab, participatory workshops, visual maps, learning prototypes, and an advisory Build Gate. Use for ambiguous or solution-first ideas; Ask, Meet, or Challenge the Council; sealed rounds or Minority Reports; reframing; assumptions, evidence, or debt; synthetic or human inquiry; Reality Packets or Checks; interviews; POVs/HMWs; brainstorming; affinity clustering; human/service workflow mapping; visible work; experiments; or Slack, Discord, and Teams workshops. Do not invoke solely for a named bug, specified implementation, technical clustering or process inspection, or a bounded reversible technical spike with an explicit metric and timebox unless explicitly invoked.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:327433:          \"long_description\": \"Biohub ESM helps you understand proteins from a name, sequence, or file: explore mutation landscapes, interpret what ESMC sees, predict and view all-atom structures, and discover related proteins. It chooses the right ESM workflow, preserves confidence and provenance, and presents results automatically. It also supports MSA-guided and modified-complex workflows, binder planning, and private or large-scale compute routing.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:327507:            \"description\": \"Use when the user needs ESMFold2 all-atom folding for proteins, DNA, RNA, modified residues, or ligands, including Fast/full routing, MSA, confidence, structures, and provenance. Not for dynamics, experimental truth, Atlas discovery, or binder campaigns.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:330567:              \"default_prompt\": \"Use $codegraph-ast-grep to expose setup, update, and doctor; select and announce the task-matching workflow when intent and authority are clear, otherwise ask. Preserve installer provenance and protected state, keep doctor non-repairing, require exact-root approval before possibly migrating graph diagnostics, and persist repository guidance for automatic CodeGraph plus ast-grep CLI use after setup.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:331932:            \"name\": \"auditer-provenance-logicielle\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:331933:            \"description\": \"Use when software provenance, SBOM, dependency origin, licenses, signatures, or build attestations matter.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:331935:              \"display_name\": \"auditer-provenance-logicielle\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:331936:              \"short_description\": \"Use when software provenance, SBOM, dependency origin, licenses, signatures, or build attestations matter.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:335226:            \"description\": \"Inspect untrusted, downloaded, shared, or third-party agent skills before installation or execution. Use when a user wants to install, import, copy, update, approve, or review a skill, plugin-like skill bundle, scripts, dependencies, or agent instructions from GitHub, a marketplace, archive, website, or another person; detect prompt injection, data exfiltration, secret access, unsafe commands, hidden payloads, excessive permissions, provenance gaps, and supply-chain risks without executing untrusted code.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:335250:            \"description\": \"Convert messy notes, chats, files, transcripts, links, and mixed sources into an organized knowledge system with taxonomy, summaries, entities, decisions, procedures, FAQs, provenance, contradictions, gaps, and retrieval paths. Use for knowledge bases, research organization, company wikis, or cleaning information overload.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:335286:            \"description\": \"Independently verify a material implementation checkpoint or technical/visual gate before a project advances, using revision-bound evidence, claim classification, technical and perceptual results, reviewer provenance and routed failure causes. Use when a user asks whether an implementer report is sufficient to advance to the next gate during implementation. Read-only: not for pre-development specification audit, implementation, repair or final release verification.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:337532:            \"description\": \"Use host-native Python for deterministic Creator Workspace tasks such as export parsing, provenance tracing, analytics, indexing, and package verification.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:344349:            \"description\": \"Design, run, or audit a mathematical computation that supports a research claim, including symbolic, exact, finite-field, representation-theoretic, homological, or numerical experiments. Use when correctness, provenance, tested range, reproducibility, or interpretation matters. Do not present bounded output as a universal proof.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:344457:            \"description\": \"Track exact mathematical claims, evidence revisions, dependency impact, audit provenance, research routes, and parallel or delayed executions in a local append-only ledger. Use when a project has a .mathbox ledger or the user asks for executable research-state tracking, stale-evidence detection, run reconciliation, or a dependency-aware handoff generated from recorded events. Do not initialize state for a casual math question, replace proof auditing with metadata validation, or write a prose project retrospective from status files.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:347685:            \"description\": \"Draft a durable operational decision record with status, context, alternatives, rationale, consequences, and provenance. Use for proposed or approved decisions; never infer approval from discussion.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:347688:              \"short_description\": \"Draft a durable operational decision record with status, context, alternatives, rationale, consequences, and provenance. Use for proposed or approved decisions; never infer approval from discussion.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:348704:        \"description\": \"Library-native, provenance-aware nutrition and fitness tracking skills.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:348714:          \"provenance\"\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:348718:          \"long_description\": \"Maintain a provenance-aware nutrition and fitness ledger in ChatGPT Library. Log food, hydration, and weight; correct entries without losing history; generate deterministic daily reports; and reconcile workout and activity snapshots without silently combining conflicting sources. Missing nutrient values remain unknown rather than becoming fabricated zeroes. Fitness Ledger is skills-only: it has no publisher-hosted service, telemetry, or required external account. It supports personal tracking and explanation, not medical diagnosis or treatment.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:348745:            \"description\": \"Reconcile workout and activity-source snapshots into deterministic, provenance-preserving fitness facts in ChatGPT Library files; use for validation, rest-day checks, and source conflicts.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:348757:            \"description\": \"Log food, hydration, and body weight into an auditable ChatGPT Library nutrition ledger; use for corrections, daily panels, and provenance-aware nutrient totals.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:349378:          \"long_description\": \"Guidance for designing and reviewing the human interaction layer of spreadsheets, dashboards, trackers, models, simulators, and decision tools without sacrificing correctness, provenance, or auditability.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:351497:        \"description\": \"CRA reporting obligations apply from 11 September 2026. Review whether a workspace holds the SBOM, VEX / CSAF, disclosure, provenance and release evidence needed to identify an affected component within the reporting window. Filename and path only. Free.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:351514:          \"long_description\": \"Review a workspace for software-supply-chain evidence relevant to SBOM and EU Cyber Resilience Act readiness. Check for machine-readable SBOMs, CycloneDX, SPDX, lockfiles, VEX/CSAF, vulnerability-disclosure evidence, provenance or attestations, and release records. Receive a deterministic Review Priority with clear guidance on what to review next. The workflow is local and read-only and does not certify compliance.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:355812:            \"Apply sufficiently provenanced policy\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:358313:            \"description\": \"Find and retrieve WHO Global Health Observatory indicators, country or regional observations, and CSV/JSON exports with verified indicator codes, dimensions, coverage, and provenance. Use for WHO GHO data requests; other data sources need a separate workflow.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:358316:              \"short_description\": \"Find and retrieve WHO GHO data with provenance\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:358405:            \"description\": \"Triage inbound and draft source-grounded U.S. litigation correspondence, including discovery meet-and-confer letters, settlement demands and counteroffers, and substantive pre-suit or case communications. Use when a lawyer needs a precise, review-ready draft with authority, fact provenance, deadlines, negotiation-status cautions, and a no-send gate.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:358477:            \"description\": \"Open a litigation matter through a human-confirmed intake that records the parties, role, side, forum, engagement and authority, conflicts posture, emergency dates, preservation posture, status, stable identifiers, and field-level provenance. Use when a new dispute, claim, subpoena, regulatory inquiry, investigation, or pre-suit threat needs a controlled matter record and a handoff to organize-case-docs.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:358489:            \"description\": \"Turn an accepted or active litigation matter’s documents and metadata into a provenance-backed case workspace with source inventory, chronology, proof charts, issue and evidence mapping, trackers, lifecycle controls, and an explicit docreview handoff. Use after controlled intake or when restructuring, updating, or closing a matter; use new-matter to create the initial matter record.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:358492:              \"short_description\": \"Build a provenance-backed case workspace\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:358713:            \"description\": \"Review counterparty contracts, outbound drafts, or revised contract packages against an approved Playbook Engine contract playbook. Start from Standard Baseline, suggest but never auto-activate Matter Lenses, prove document and rule coverage, and deliver a clause-anchored issues list showing exact source text, visible suggested inline markup, clean proposed text, and drafting provenance. Do not create or apply a Word redline.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:369881:          \"provenance\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:370578:          \"long_description\": \"Compound Writing provides a full toolbox for developing ideas, drafting, revising, pressure-testing, and preparing work for publication. Scribe acts as the context-aware front door: it helps a first-time writer establish one portable writing home when needed, or starts directly from an existing draft or workspace. The system preserves source provenance, writer voice, and human ownership of consequential decisions. Optional audience context records who you write for, what they know and want, and the evidence behind those observations. A blank template helps you establish your own guide or reuse a maintained shared source.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:370676:            \"description\": \"Turn an outline, notes, source material, or partial prose into a complete draft while preserving the writer's voice, thesis ownership, and source provenance. Use when the user asks to draft a piece or section.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:370679:              \"short_description\": \"Turn an outline, notes, source material, or partial prose into a complete draft while preserving the writer's voice, thesis ownership, and source provenance. Use when the user asks to draft a piece or section.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:372421:            \"description\": \"Reconcile conflicting evidence across sources while preserving provenance and uncertainty.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:372424:              \"short_description\": \"Reconcile conflicting evidence across sources while preserving provenance and uncertainty.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:374197:            \"description\": \"Audit persistent information an AI agent can reuse across sessions, including provenance, sensitivity, staleness, contradictions, scope, and deletion evidence. Use when someone asks what an assistant remembers about them or a project, or wants a memory cleanup plan. Do not delete or rewrite memories without explicit approval.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:374200:              \"short_description\": \"Audit reusable AI memory and its provenance\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:374543:            \"description\": \"Generate and retrieve ad creative assets with the juicy CLI — generate a first frame from a prompt, edit a reference frame, animate a frame into a clip (image-to-video), generate a soundtrack, download free sample assets, verify the .media/manifest.jsonl provenance gate, and check credits. Use whenever a workflow needs an image, video clip or music track produced by juicy, when a generation call fails or times out and must be resumed with juicy job get, when a manifest verify gate must pass, or when credits, sign-in or setup with juicy are in question.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:374546:              \"short_description\": \"Generate and retrieve ad creative assets with the juicy CLI — generate a first frame from a prompt, edit a reference frame, animate a frame into a clip (image-to-video), generate a soundtrack, download free sample assets, verify the .media/manifest.jsonl provenance gate, and check credits. Use whenever a workflow needs an image, video clip or music track produced by juicy, when a generation call fails or times out and must be resumed with juicy job get, when a manifest verify gate must pass, or when credits, sign-in or setup with juicy are in question.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:375458:        \"description\": \"Discover UN SDG indicators and series, retrieve complete observations, and preserve DSIR cleaning semantics with dimensions and provenance.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:375497:            \"description\": \"Discover UN Sustainable Development Goal indicators and statistical series, retrieve country or regional observations, and export verified data with units, dimensions and provenance. Use for UN SDG database questions, including health-related SDGs; WHO GHO uses a separate workflow.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:382477:            \"description\": \"Inspect untrusted, downloaded, shared, or third-party agent skills before installation or execution. Use when a user wants to install, import, copy, update, approve, or review a skill, plugin-like skill bundle, scripts, dependencies, or agent instructions from GitHub, a marketplace, archive, website, or another person; detect prompt injection, data exfiltration, secret access, unsafe commands, hidden payloads, excessive permissions, provenance gaps, and supply-chain risks without executing untrusted code.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:382489:            \"description\": \"Convert messy notes, chats, files, transcripts, links, and mixed sources into an organized knowledge system with taxonomy, summaries, entities, decisions, procedures, FAQs, provenance, contradictions, gaps, and retrieval paths. Use for knowledge bases, research organization, company wikis, or cleaning information overload.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:382525:            \"description\": \"Independently verify a material implementation checkpoint or technical/visual gate before a project advances, using revision-bound evidence, claim classification, technical and perceptual results, reviewer provenance and routed failure causes. Use when a user asks whether an implementer report is sufficient to advance to the next gate during implementation. Read-only: not for pre-development specification audit, implementation, repair or final release verification.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:384100:            \"description\": \"Audit, fix or verify artifact provenance, release promotion, rollback compatibility, backup integrity and disaster recovery. Restore and failure drills require an appropriate authorized environment.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:395473:            \"description\": \"Review packages, lockfiles, scripts, provenance, licensing, advisories, and dependency risk.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:395476:              \"short_description\": \"Review packages, lockfiles, scripts, provenance, licensing, advisories, and dependency risk.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:398989:          \"long_description\": \"Twelve focused skills for researchers working on cryptographic constructions and papers, especially secure multiparty computation and zero-knowledge proofs.\\n\\nFormulate research questions, trace literature claims to primary sources, draft and minimally edit technical prose, and examine security arguments under their stated definitions and assumptions. For implementation work, use separate workflows for protocol correspondence, benchmark accounting, evaluation writing, and reproducible artifacts.\\n\\nThe skills emphasize precise models, evidence provenance, conservative claims, and keeping the requested scope small. Proof audits distinguish confirmed errors, proof gaps, unstated assumptions, and unverified dependencies. They are read-only unless edits or proof completion are requested.\\n\\nThis package provides workflow instructions and references. It does not certify security, replace expert review, or supply a proof assistant. The host agent's available tools determine which searches, file edits, builds, and experiments can actually run.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:404262:            \"description\": \"Lire les éléments accessibles d’un GPT à partir de son URL ou de contenus fournis, inventorier leur provenance et détecter les informations manquantes avant une conversion en plugin.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:404265:              \"short_description\": \"Lire les éléments accessibles d’un GPT à partir de son URL ou de contenus fournis, inventorier leur provenance et détecter les informations manquantes avant une conversion en plugin.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:405931:          \"long_description\": \"A public-equity research workstation built on analyst manual. It enforces current primary-source research, point-in-time provenance, evidence and claim graphs, deterministic accounting and valuation calculations, dependency gates, independent red teams, management prediction scoring, forecast-error attribution, evidence freshness, research-confidence scoring, EVoI prioritization, 36 sector models, and automated audits. Tip Jar: https://ko-fi.com/quietengine\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:419667:            \"description\": \"Code reviews by product aspect and expressed sentiment while retaining ambiguity and evidence provenance.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:419670:              \"short_description\": \"Code reviews by product aspect and expressed sentiment while retaining ambiguity and evidence provenance.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/remote_plugin_catalog/1254b5fb77bc5b4b.json:431177:          \"long_description\": \"TubeCue retrieves manual or auto-generated YouTube captions with a bundled transcript API, verifies video provenance, and creates source-grounded summaries, answers, study notes, chapter breakdowns, comparisons, and fact-checks. It uses an interactive Tactiq fallback when direct retrieval is blocked.\",\n/home/ftmon/whyfs-provenance-decision-20260929T125733/agent-homes/18-case09-baseline/cache/codex_apps_tools/bd0ffbcb108887e5af4a9146acf935d46a08d692.json:3430:        \"description\": \"Get a saved site version and its source provenance. Retain version_id for follow-up calls, but report the user-facing version number when possible.\",\n/etc/whyfs/scope.conf:1:# whyfs scope additions (defaults: /usr/lib/whyfs/scope-default.conf; restart whyfs.service after edits)\n/etc/mime.types:353:application/provenance+xml\t\t\tprovx\n/etc/mime.types:661:application/vnd.cncf.helm.chart.provenance.v1.prov\n/etc/mime.types:2130:text/provenance-notation\t\t\tprovn\n","exit_code":2,"status":"failed"}}
